    "filename": "Istanbul Turkish and Islamic Museum Cizre mosque doors knocker in 2006 01 7565.jpg",
    "title": "File:Istanbul Turkish and Islamic Museum Cizre mosque doors knocker in 2006 01 7565.jpg",
    "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e7/Istanbul_Turkish_and_Islamic_Museum_Cizre_mosque_doors_knocker_in_2006_01_7565.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
    "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Istanbul_Turkish_and_Islamic_Museum_Cizre_mosque_doors_knocker_in_2006_01_7565.jpg",
    "width": 4256,
    "height": 2832,
